Homing

=== Resonance map: motor A @ current registers ===
  speed   vibration
    40   ###                                 51
    50   #############                      261
    60   ################################   639

VFAs (fine vertical banding) come from cruising on a motor resonance — that is what this map catches, so avoid the peaks above. It is NOT your top print speed: the motor holds torque far past any commanded speed (CHOPPER_ENVELOPE), the real ceiling is hotend flow, and corner ringing is the input shaper (SHAPER_CALIBRATE).
Report: <tmp>/dataset/report.html (done in 0m)
